{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.03ac38aa116dcedc3a9c1ae4.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The named selected control is Q3's three-factor licensing-trigger test, after regulated-activity carve-outs have been resolved.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.03ac38aa116dcedc3a9c1ae4.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The required Boolean label uses 'COMPLIANT' solely to mean that this selected trigger test is satisfied; true does not mean the office holds a licence or complies with licensing law.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.03ac38aa116dcedc3a9c1ae4.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"All facts concern the same assessed office, services and business in the same assessment context.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.03ac38aa116dcedc3a9c1ae4.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Professional assessments retain all source qualifications; unavailable or unresolved facts remain unknown.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"f85cfd31eb6139fc06bcf6676e47eff56fd3a9bded513c5f6e1cf1aaa318fa3f","candidate_id":"candidate.ca224dad3e484eb1939ae0fe6b782aee","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For the selected Q3 licensing-trigger test, true means all three stated conditions are satisfied: the assessed services constitute at least one regulated activity after applicable carve-outs; the office carries on a business providing those services; and that same business is carried on in Hong Kong. False means this conjunction is not satisfied. Neither outcome determines licence possession or whole-entity compliance. Business classification remains case-specific and preserves the qualified ordinary-course guidance.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["dependencies"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.ea8f538310c04fc78c9fd54fffbf0fe2","issue.19df610642734952b7ef49f05fa037c8","issue.d4c0107353644c56bd44fa66345f5e97","issue.bd4952f9b5c2460f8